cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CardioOncoPredict: research software for measuring microvolt T-wave alternans"
abstract: >-
  Open research software that measures microvolt T-wave alternans in ECG recordings
  with the Spectral Method and Modified Moving Average, in Python and in the browser,
  to test whether alternans precedes anthracycline cardiotoxicity. The hypothesis is
  unproven; the software is not a medical device.
